 million during the nine months ended September 30, 2024, to $37.6 million during the current nine-month period. Of this amount $1.9 million relates to costs associated with our acquisition of Cornerstone. Merger transaction costs that facilitate the merger are not deductible for income tax purposes. Of the $1.9 million in merger related costs, $946 thousand is estimated to be not deductible for state and federal income tax."}],"pretax":[{"heading":null,"text":"Net interest income before provision for credit losses. Driven by growth in the loan portfolio, the acquisition of Cornerstone and repayment of Bank Term Funding Program (BTFP) borrowings, net interest income increased by $7.2 million from $54.7 million during the nine months ended September 30, 2024, to $61.9 million for the nine months ended September 30, 2025. The increase in net interest income includes an increase of $8.0 million in interest income partially offset by an increase of $0.8 million in interest expense. See \"Short-term Borrowing Arrangements\" for a discussion of BTFP borrowing activity."}],"tax":[{"heading":null,"text":"The provision for income taxes decreased from $7.5 million, or 26.4% of pre-tax income, during the nine months ended September 30, 2024 to $7.0 million, or 27.2% of pre-tax income, during the current nine-month period."}],"net":[{"heading":null,"text":"Net Income. The Company recorded net income of $18.6 million for the nine months ended September 30, 2025, down from net income of $20.9 million for the nine months ended September 30, 2024. Increases of $7.2 million in net interest income and $1.2 million in non-interest income, and a decline of $0.5 million in the provision for income taxes were offset by an increase of $5.1 million in the provision for credit losses and an increase of $6.0 million in non-interest expense. The annualized return on average assets was 0.90% for the three months ended September 30, 2025, down from 1.84% for the three months ended September 30, 2024. The annualized return on average equity decreased from 18.1% during the third quarter of 2024 to 8.5% during the current quarter."}]},"capex_src":{"concept":"us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment","label":"Purchase of premises and equipment","how":"xbrl"},"src":{"revenue":{"c":"us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerIncludingAssessedTax","l":"Revenue from Contract with Customer, Including Assessed Tax","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"pretax":{"c":"us-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesExtraordinaryItemsNoncontrollingInterest","l":"us-gaap_Income Loss From Continuing Operations Before Income Taxes Extraordinary Items Noncontrolling Interest","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"tax":{"c":"us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit","l":"Provision for Income Taxes","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ni":{"c":"us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss","l":"Net income","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ocf":{"c":"us-gaap:NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities","l":"us-gaap_Net Cash Provided By Used In Operating Activities","ytd":true,"how":"xbrl"},"da":{"c":"us-gaap:DepreciationAmortizationAndAccretionNet","l":"Depreciation, Amortization and Accretion, Net","ytd":true,"how":"xbrl"},"sbc":{"c":"us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation","l":"Share-based Payment Arrangement, Noncash Expense","ytd":true,"how":"xbrl"},"rev_contract":{"c":"us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerIncludingAssessedTax","l":"Revenue from Contract with Customer, Including Assessed Tax","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"capex":{"c":"us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment","l":"Purchase of premises and equipment","ytd":true,"how":"xbrl"}},"co_fcf":null,"co_status":"not_reported","co_errors":0,"co_tried":1}},"dims_ytd":{"2025-03-31":{},"2025-06-30":{},"2025-09-30":{}},"keep":7,"hist":2,"profile":{"cik":1168455,"name":"PLUMAS BANCORP","tickers":["PLBC"],"exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sic":"6153","industry":"Short-Term Business Credit Institutions","sector":"financials","fye":"1231","state":"CA","category":"Non-accelerated filer